  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::UIAnimLab.Station
  Code: V6
  Title: Play mode and recompiles end a preview
  Summary: A preview left running must be put back before play mode backs the scene
    up, and before scripts reload.
  Watch: Box
  WatchObjects:
  - {fileID: 1190369019}
  HowTo: Play Grow, then enter play mode, then exit. Play Grow again, then make a
    script recompile (e.g. add a space to any .cs file and save).
  Expect: In play mode Box is its normal size, and still is after exiting. After
    the recompile, Box is back to normal size too.
