  Title: Materials go back after a preview
  Summary: A material step gives its element a material copy while previewing; ending
    the preview must give the element its own material back.
  Watch: Heart
  WatchObjects:
  - {fileID: 1946765904}
  HowTo: 'Select Heart. Note its Image''s Material: Lab Glow. Select this tile, Play
    Glow, select Heart again and look at the material at the bottom of its Inspector.
    Stop and Restore, then look again.'
  Expect: During the preview the material reads Lab Glow (Instance), and the material
    editor at the bottom shows the instance. After Stop and Restore, it reads Lab
    Glow again, and the material editor shows the asset.
