  m_text: '<b>Expect:</b> Preview: Credits jumps to fully shown at once, holds, then
    fades out - every preview Play is Reset then Play. Play mode: it stays dim for
    0.6 s, then flashes to full and fades - the setting is off, and the preview deliberately
    doesn''t copy that.'
