  Code: V7
  Title: Saving the scene mid-preview
  Summary: Saving while a preview runs must save the scene at rest - including each
    element's own material - and carry on.
  Watch: Box, Fill Bar, TMP
  WatchObjects:
  - {fileID: 1935284178}
  - {fileID: 60279832}
  - {fileID: 996459932}
  HowTo: 'Play Change. Press Ctrl+S. Then Stop and Restore. (Optionally: close and
    reopen the scene.)'
  Expect: Saving doesn't visibly change anything - the preview carries on. After
    Stop and Restore the scene doesn't show as changed. Reopened, the box is at rest,
    the bar full, the text thin, and the Fill Bar's material is Lab Fill, not an
    (Instance).
