  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::UIAnimLab.Station
  Code: V1
  Title: Previews carry on from each other
  Summary: Open slides the drawer right; Close slides it back. Neither has a From.
  Watch: Drawer
  WatchObjects:
  - {fileID: 922991250}
  HowTo: Play Open, wait, then Play Close. Then Stop and Restore. Then Play Close
    on its own.
  Expect: Close starts from where Open finished and slides back. Stop and Restore
    returns to rest. Close on its own from rest does nothing visible - it's already
    home.
